                <span begin="00:00:26.042" end="00:00:29.852">花</span>
                <span begin="00:00:29.852" end="00:00:30.929"> </span>
                <span begin="00:00:30.929" end="00:00:31.977">あ</span>
                <span begin="00:00:31.977" end="00:00:32.905">の</span>
                <span begin="00:00:32.905" end="00:00:34.946">声</span>
                <span begin="00:00:34.946" end="00:00:38.944">が</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation">黑色的花 破灭之声</span>
            </p>
